          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare-naca Rwot bino dino kal cakere i kulo Eufrate tuno naka i kulo me Miciri; Rwot bino cokowu acel acel, wun jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok daŋ i ninonaca, obino kuto twon apelloro adwoŋ meicel, eka jo ame rik onwoŋo orwenyo i lobo me Acuria kede ame onwoŋo oryemo owoto i lobo me Miciri. Gin bino dwogo, ote bino woro Rwot i wi kidi acil, i Jerucalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
